4. OFFLINE SYSTEM

Implement a complete offline-first architecture.

When offline:

- Detect immediately
- Show offline state where necessary
- Preserve authenticated state
- Preserve cached feed metadata
- Preserve previously loaded content
- Avoid infinite network retries
- Do not crash
- Do not display fake demo data

When network returns:

Automatically:

- Reconnect Firebase
- Restart required listeners
- Detect new content
- Sync latest metadata
- Update Home
- Update Feels
- Update Posts
- Update Channel
- Update Watch Page

No manual refresh should be required.

